    "renderer": "unmodified official UMD with React 18.3.1",
    "source": "ConfigProvider.upload style/semantic slots, accept and customRequest",
    "observation": "13 raw style/accept cases cover provider/local slots and callback raw props, empty local slots versus reset provider, nested/sibling scopes and drag. Two real input selections capture provider/customRequest override callbacks. Four live provider transitions. Raw synchronous completion leaves completed requests in rc-upload request storage, causing abort on later unmount. Native keeps its existing completion guard. Separate publicRequests use a deferred completion after all raw cases and transitions; only the cross-instance abort observation uses this counterpart. Four additional raw progress samples cover inherited settings, local showInfo override, empty local object and local size override."
  },
